<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MYRIAD CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MYRIAD CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Myriad Genetics Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- said Myriad may face competition for its genetic breast cancer test following the patent that was recently awarded to OncorMed Inc.</p>
<p>-- said cut the 12-month price target to $33 from $41.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed expectations on Myriad's potential market penetration for the years after 1999 to 60 percent from 100 percent.</p>
<p>-- Myriad lost 1-5/8 to 23-7/8.</p>
</text>
